<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Receive products / PO · D’ RAW</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/warehouse-ui.css"><style>body{font:16px system-ui;background:#fff4e8;color:#251044;padding:18px;margin:0}main{max-width:1400px;margin:auto}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #dfd2eb;border-radius:16px;padding:18px;margin:14px 0}button{background:#411575;color:white;border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;min-height:44px;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}button.secondary{background:#eee5fa;color:#411575}.row{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}label{display:block;margin:12px 0}input,select,textarea{display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font:inherit;padding:11px;border:1px solid #d4c3e7;border-radius:10px}#results button{display:block;margin:6px 0;width:100%;text-align:left}.line-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr));gap:12px}dialog{padding:22px;border:0;border-radius:18px;background:#fff4e8;color:#251044;width:min(760px,92vw);max-height:90dvh;overflow:auto}dialog::backdrop{background:#25104499}.actions{position:sticky;bottom:0;background:#fff4e8;padding:12px 0;display:flex;gap:10px}.notice{white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:650}[hidden]{display:none!important}</style></head><body><main><a href="/workspaces">← Workspaces</a><h1>Receive products / PO</h1><p>Receive at the warehouse. Search or scan products, enter the actual quantities, and choose where accepted stock goes.</p><p id="message" class="notice" role="status"></p><button id="retry" hidden>Retry saved receipt</button><section class="card"><form id="receive"><div class="line-fields"><label>Receive against<select id="po"><option value="">Direct receiving · no PO</option></select></label><label id="vendor-label">Vendor<select id="vendor" required></select></label><label id="po-reference-label">PO number / supplier reference · optional<input id="po-reference" maxlength="100"></label></div><label>Find or scan product / SKU / barcode<input id="search" autocomplete="off" enterkeyhint="search"></label><div class="row"><button type="button" id="lookup">Look up barcode</button><button type="button" class="secondary" id="scan-camera">Scan with camera</button><button type="button" class="secondary" id="keyboard">Hide keyboard</button></div><p id="catalog-warning" role="status"></p><div id="results"></div><div id="lines"></div><label>Notes<textarea id="notes" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label><button id="save" class="primary">Save received products</button></form></section><section class="card"><h2>Recent receipts</h2><div id="receipts"></div></section><dialog id="putaway"><form id="place"><h2>Place accepted products</h2><p>Choose actual storage locations. Split quantities if a product goes to more than one location. Damaged and rejected stock is excluded.</p><div id="allocations"></div><p id="placement-error" role="alert"></p><div class="actions"><button id="confirm-place" class="primary">Confirm actual placement</button><button type="button" class="secondary" id="close">Cancel</button></div></form></dialog></main><dialog id="camera"><video autoplay playsinline style="width:100%"></video><p></p><button type="button">Close camera</button></dialog><script src="/workspaces-assets/zxing.js"></script><script type="module" src="/workspaces-assets/receiving.js"></script><script type="module" src="/workspaces-assets/dialog-dismiss.js"></script><script type="module" src="/workspaces-assets/office-notification.js"></script></body></html>